  's2.rule': [`群數規則在看到任何分群前就定好：上限 4 群內，取「每兩群的群心至少在一種氧化物上相差 ≥ 5 倍儀器預測誤差（RMSEP）」的最多群數。候選停靠點：每群最典型與最特殊的目標各一，不打分數、不加權。`, `Rule fixed before any group was seen: the most groups (at most 4) whose centres all differ by at least 5× the instrument's prediction error (RMSEP) in some oxide. Candidate stops: each group's most typical target and its most unusual one — no score, no weighting.`],
