  's2.cardNote': [`氧化物：毅力號 SuperCam LIBS（PDS），實測；群別與角色為推算。差距小於 RMSEP 不視為不同岩石。位置＝雷射發射時車的位置（site {site}、drive {drive}），岩石約在 7 m 內。這是毅力號量的，不是我們的模擬自走車。`, `Oxides: Perseverance SuperCam LIBS, PDS (measured); group and role derived. Differences smaller than the RMSEP are not treated as different rock. Position = the rover's position when it fired the laser (site {site}, drive {drive}); the rock is within about 7 m of it. Measured by Perseverance, not by our simulated rover.`],
  's2.cardUnlocked': [`我們的自走車開到 15 m 內才「解鎖」它。`, `Our rover unlocked it by driving within 15 m.`],
