  's2.smpNear': [`15 m 內 {n} 個目標：{g}`, `{n} targets within 15 m — {g}`],
  's2.smpNone': [`這組資料沒有量測`, `no measurement in this data set`],
  's2.smpNote': [`任務實際鑽取的地方，以及那些岩石落在哪一群。只是描述：停靠點沒有排名，所以沒有檢定；採樣點也沒用來訂任何規則。`, `Where the mission actually drilled, and which group those rocks fall in. Only a description: the candidate stops are not ranked, so there is no test, and the sampling sites were not used to set any rule.`],
  'r7.lead': [`從居住艙出發，一趟走完 {n} 個停靠點再回來，每站停 {dwell} 分鐘。`, `One walk from the habitat to the {n} stops and back, {dwell} minutes at each stop.`],
  'r7.reached': [`抵達站數`, `Stops reached`],
  'r7.vsA': [`比 A 耗氧`, `vs A: O2`],
  'r7.none': [`「全部資料」的多站步行只用第二版自走車算過，這裡不顯示。`, `The multi-stop walk for all data was only computed with the version-2 rover; not shown here.`],
  'r7.notes': [`「抵達」＝在某站停留後，照計畫的路走回家，在參考地形上仍在可用的 {u} 標稱分鐘內。每種地圖自己決定拜訪順序，再放到參考地形上走，不重新規劃。停靠點離居住艙最遠 {km} km。停留時間以停留分鐘數計氧（假設）。<b>這一輪是在第一次比較之後才設計的；63 點的比較仍是事前登記的主結果。</b>地圖上的虛線＝這一趟的路線 A（橘）與路線 B（藍）。`,
    `"Reached" = after the stay at a stop, walking home the plan's own way still fits the usable {u} on the reference terrain. Each map picks its own order; the plan is then walked on the reference terrain without replanning. The stops lie up to {km} km from the habitat. Each stay counts its minutes as nominal minutes of oxygen (assumed). <b>This round was designed after seeing the first comparison; the 63-point comparison stays the pre-registered main result.</b> Map: dashed lines = this walk for route A (orange) and route B (blue).`],

