  'rc.pm.note': [`所有數值都是跑之前就定的假設，沒有依路線比較結果調整。`, `All values were set before the run; none was tuned on route comparisons.`],
  'rc.ab.title': [`第 1 步・自走車偵察怎麼運作`, `Step 1 · Scout rover recon — how it works`],
  'rc.ab.sim': [`<b>自走車是模擬的。</b>它的路線由我們的規劃程式產生，不是毅力號，也不沿毅力號的路線走；本頁沒有使用毅力號的量測。`, `<b>The rover is simulated.</b> Its loops are produced by our planner; it is not Perseverance and does not follow Perseverance's route. Perseverance's own measurements are not used on this page.`],
  'rc.ab.knowsH': [`自走車知道什麼`, `What the rover knows`],
  'rc.ab.before': [`<b>出發前</b>只有任何任務規劃者都拿得到的軌道資料：CTX 地形模型（20 m）與影像，由此得出堅實／崎嶇／坡度不可通行。CTX 看不到沙紋。`, `<b>Before leaving</b> it has only orbital data available to any mission planner: the CTX terrain model (20 m) and image. Terrain classes from it: firm / rough / blocked by slope. CTX cannot show sand ripples.`],
  'rc.ab.driving': [`<b>行駛中</b>把自己周圍 {r} m 的圓「刮開」：圓內地圖換成 <i>HiRISE 參考地形</i>（1 m 地形、0.25 m 影像）。HiRISE 也是軌道資料，用來代替自走車自己的相機會量到的東西（模擬感測），不是地面真值。`, `<b>While driving</b> it "scratches off" a disc of {r} m around itself. Inside that disc the map switches to the <i>HiRISE reference terrain</i> (1 m terrain model, 0.25 m image). HiRISE is also orbital: it stands in for what the rover's own cameras would measure (simulated sensing). It is not ground truth.`],
  'rc.ab.noPeek': [`規劃程式從不讀取還沒刮開的 HiRISE 數值（程式強制並經測試）。`, `The planner never reads HiRISE values it has not scratched off (enforced in code and tested).`],
  'rc.ab.loopH': [`一圈怎麼走`, `One loop`],
  'rc.ab.goalV3': [`選目標（第三版）：在「已看過／沒看過」的邊界上，挑「預期新看到的面積 ÷ 預期成本」最高的點（Yamauchi 1997；Burgard et al. 2005；Singh et al. 2009）；沒看過的地面用目前學到的機率估期望成本（Sofman et al. 2006）。只看地形：不使用科學價值或毅力號資料。`, `Pick a goal (version 3): among frontier cells between seen and unseen ground, the one with the most expected new area per expected cost (Yamauchi 1997; Burgard et al. 2005; Singh et al. 2009); unseen ground is priced at its expected cost from the probabilities learned so far (Sofman et al. 2006). Terrain only: no science value and no Perseverance data are used.`],
  'rc.ab.goalV2': [`選目標（第二版）：八個方位輪流（N、S、E、W、NE、SW、SE、NW），近 100–600 m、中 600–1200 m、遠 &gt;1200 m 三個距離帶每八圈輪換；在該方位與距離帶內選周圍未知面積最多、且不超過規劃預算 {o}% 的目標。只看地形：不使用科學價值或毅力號資料。`, `Pick a goal (rule v2): the eight compass sectors take turns (N, S, E, W, NE, SW, SE, NW), and distance bands near 100–600 m, mid 600–1200 m, far &gt;1200 m take turns every eight loops; within that sector and band, the goal with the most unexplored area around it, at most {o}% of the planning budget away. Terrain only: no science value and no Perseverance data are used.`],
  'rc.ab.drive': [`用目前的地圖開過去。前方新看到的格子若不可通行或比預期貴很多，就重新選目標或重新規劃。`, `Drive there on its current map. If a newly seen cell ahead is impassable or costs much more than expected, reselect or replan.`],
  'rc.ab.turn': [`當（已用能量＋回家預估成本 × 餘裕）達到規劃預算時，自己掉頭。餘裕從 ×{m} 起，並調高到地形實際比軌道地圖預測多花的比例。`, `Turn back by itself when (energy spent + planned cost home × margin) reaches the planning budget. The margin starts at ×{m} and is raised to how much more the terrain has cost than the orbital map predicted.`],
  'rc.ab.home': [`換條路回家：回程時已看過的格子成本 ×{p}。`, `Go home a different way: cells already seen cost ×{p} on the way back.`],
  'rc.ab.reserve': [`備用規則（保證）：永遠保留足夠能量，能沿<i>已看過</i>的地形回家（硬性規則；測試：紀錄中沒有一圈超出預算）。餘裕用完時就走那條路回家（綠色虛線）。`, `Reserve rule (guarantee): it keeps enough energy to get home over terrain it has <i>already seen</i> (hard rule; tested: no loop of the recorded run exceeds its budget). When that margin runs out, it goes home that way (dashed green).`],
  'rc.ab.unitH': [`能量單位`, `Energy units`],
  'rc.ab.unit': [`1 能量單位＝在堅實地面開 1 m（崎嶇 ×2.5、沙地 ×6；假設）。是相對值，不是瓦時。`, `1 energy unit = 1 m on firm ground (rough ×2.5, sand ×6; assumed). Relative units, not watt-hours.`],
  'rc.ab.checksH': [`驗收檢查`, `Acceptance checks`],
  'rc.ab.paramsH': [`參數`, `Parameters`],
  'rc.ab.lSim': [`自走車路線、事件與統計`, `rover routes, events and statistics`],
  'rc.ab.lAss': [`預算、成本、半徑、門檻`, `budget, costs, radius, thresholds`],
  'rc.ab.lMea': [`HiRISE 與 CTX 資料（軌道）`, `HiRISE and CTX data (orbital)`],
  'rc.ab.L.classes': [`地形類別是由坡度、粗糙度與影像紋理指標得出的啟發式結果；尤其沙地類別尚未經人工審閱。`, `Terrain classes are a heuristic from slope, roughness and an image texture index; the sand class in particular (heuristic, not yet reviewed) still needs a person to check it.`],
  'rc.ab.L.params': [`預算、成本係數（堅實 1、崎嶇 2.5、沙地 6）與 15 m 感測半徑都是跑之前就鎖定的假設，沒有為了結果調整。`, `Budget, cost factors (firm 1, rough 2.5, sand 6) and the 15 m sensing radius are assumptions locked before the run, not tuned for the result.`],
  'rc.ab.L.v3': [`第三版是看過第二版的覆蓋結果後才設計的；第二版（事前登記的紀錄）用網址 <code>?rule=v2</code> 可看。第三版跑的過程中有一次程式錯誤，修正後重跑一次，本頁顯示的是重跑結果；經過見 DATA_LOG。`, `Version 3 was designed after seeing version 2's coverage; version 2 (the pre-registered record) is at <code>?rule=v2</code>. A program bug in a version-3 run was fixed and the run repeated once; this page shows the rerun; see DATA_LOG.`],
  'rc.ab.L.res': [`自走車看到的與軌道先驗差這麼多，主要來自資料解析度（CTX 20 m 對 HiRISE 1 m），不是自走車特別聰明。`, `The big difference between what the rover saw and the orbital prior comes from data resolution (CTX 20 m vs HiRISE 1 m), not from cleverness of the rover.`],

