  'dt.src.photoviews': [`由原始影像中繼資料推算：相機模型依車體姿態旋轉；用 3 張 Navcam 天際線對照 CTX 地平線檢查（誤差 1° 內）。只畫 Navcam。`, `Derived from the Raw Images metadata: camera model rotated by the rover attitude; checked on 3 Navcam skylines against the CTX horizon (within 1°). Navcam only.`],
  'dt.src.photos': [`依 site/drive 與航點精確比對放置。Navcam 拍攝方向畫成扇形（推算）；Front Hazcam 與 Mastcam-Z 的方向未驗證，不畫。`, `Placed by exact site/drive match with a waypoint. Navcam viewing directions are drawn as wedges (derived); Front Hazcam and Mastcam-Z directions are not verified and not drawn.`],
  'dt.src.base': [`假設的居住艙位置：Octavia E. Butler 著陸點＝毅力號第一個航點（site 3、drive 0、sol 13）。`, `Habitat placed at Octavia E. Butler Landing = first Perseverance waypoint (site 3, drive 0, sol 13).`],
  'dt.src.aoi': [`2400 m 見方、包含居住艙（距邊 ≥ 300 m），以 100 m 滑動，取涵蓋最多 sol ≤ 400 毅力號航點的位置（122 個中 118 個在內；MVP_PLAN 5.2）。`, `MVP_PLAN 5.2: 2400 m square containing base (>= 300 m from edge), 100 m sliding steps, maximising Perseverance waypoints with sol <= 400 (118 of 122 inside).`],
  'dt.src.geo': [`裁切到 12 km 範圍並簡化（約 3 m）。沒有對齊 HiRISE：先前發現與 CTX 有 100–200 m 偏移，未修正。`, `Clipped to the 12 km context window and simplified (~3 m). Not registered to HiRISE: a 100-200 m offset against CTX was noted earlier and is not corrected.`],
