  'dt.ab.title': [`圖資：這頁看什麼`, `Marswalk Recon — map data`],
  'dt.ab.intro': [`整個專案的成品是給太空人用的分層地圖與步行路線：自走車先自己出艙探索、回來，它的發現決定太空人該去哪、怎麼在氧氣預算內走到。<b>這頁只展示其他頁用到的地圖與真實影像</b>，不含路線或模擬。`, `Goal of the full project: an astronaut-ready layered map and walking route. A scout rover leaves the habitat on its own, explores, returns, and its findings decide where astronauts should go and how they get there within an oxygen budget. <b>This page only shows the maps and real imagery</b> the other pages use; no route or simulation is shown here.`],
  'dt.ab.whatH': [`你在看什麼`, `What you are looking at`],
  'dt.ab.ref': [`<b>參考地形</b>：HiRISE 正射影像（0.25 m）與地形（1 m）。它是軌道資料，我們稱之為 <i>HiRISE 參考地形</i>，不是地面真值。`, `<b>Reference terrain</b>: HiRISE orthoimage (0.25 m) and DTM (1 m). It is orbital data — we call it <i>HiRISE reference terrain</i>, not ground truth.`],
  'dt.ab.prior': [`<b>先驗地形</b>：沒有偵察時規劃者手上的 CTX 地形（20 m）。用「比較地形解析度」看看 20 m 會少掉什麼。`, `<b>Prior terrain</b>: the CTX DTM (20 m) a planner would have without scouting. Use <i>Compare terrain resolution</i> to see what disappears at 20 m.`],
  'dt.ab.ground': [`<b>毅力號地面資料（Jezero）</b>：行駛路線、航點與原始影像；每張影像依它帶的 site/drive 計數掛到對應航點。`, `<b>Rover ground data (Jezero)</b>: Perseverance traverse, waypoints and raw images, each image attached to the waypoint whose site/drive counter it carries.`],
  'dt.ab.base': [`<b>居住艙</b>：<i>假設</i>的位置（Jezero 的 Octavia E. Butler 著陸點），也是本地公尺座標（x 向東、y 向北）的原點。`, `<b>Habitat (base)</b>: an <i>assumed</i> location (Octavia E. Butler Landing at Jezero). It is the origin of the local metre grid (x east, y north).`],
  'dt.ab.lMea': [`公開的儀器資料`, `instrument data as published`],
  'dt.ab.lDer': [`我們由實測資料計算（陰影、坡度、研究區）`, `computed by us from measured data (hillshade, slope, AOI)`],
  'dt.ab.lAss': [`我們的選擇，不是觀測`, `our choice, not an observation`],
  'dt.ab.lSim': [`模型輸出（本頁沒有）`, `model output (none on this page)`],
  'dt.ab.srcH': [`資料來源（本場景）`, `Data sources (this scene)`],
  'dt.ab.thData': [`資料`, `Data`],
  'dt.ab.thMission': [`任務／提供者`, `Mission / provider`],
  'dt.ab.thLabel': [`標籤`, `Label`],
  'dt.ab.thRes': [`挑戰官方資源`, `Challenge Resources item`],
  'dt.ab.refs': [`另外當作參考（不是資料）的挑戰官方資源：<i>Curiosity's Proposed Path up Mount Sharp</i>（路線地圖樣式）與 <i>NASA Worldview</i>（圖層清單）。含連結的完整清單：專案的 DATA_LOG.md 與 docs/REFERENCES.md。`, `Challenge Resources also used as references, not data: <i>Curiosity's Proposed Path up Mount Sharp</i> (map style for routes) and <i>NASA Worldview</i> (layer list). Full list with links: DATA_LOG.md and docs/REFERENCES.md in the repository.`],
  'dt.ab.L.orbital': [`HiRISE 與 CTX 都是軌道資料。小於約 1 m 的自走車尺度危險（單顆岩石、鬆軟沙質）即使在參考地形中也解析不出來。`, `HiRISE and CTX are both orbital. Rover-scale hazards smaller than about 1 m (single rocks, soft sand texture) are not resolved even in the reference terrain.`],
  'dt.ab.L.shift': [`CTX 先驗以一次整體影像對齊平移（東 {e} m、北 {n} m）與 {v} m 的垂直偏移放到 HiRISE 座標上；HiRISE 是位置基準。門檻（X3）是在 Arcadia 第一次量測後、任何路線數字出現前定的。`, `The CTX prior was moved by one global image-registration shift ({e} m E, {n} m N) and a vertical offset of {v} m so it sits on the HiRISE frame; HiRISE is the positional reference. Thresholds (X3) were fixed after the first Arcadia measurements and before any route numbers existed.`],
  'dt.ab.L.x3': [`<b>鎖定的 X3 MOLA 高程檢查在這裡沒有通過</b>（HiRISE − MOLA {hm} ± {hs} m；CTX − MOLA 標準差 {cs} m；門檻 10 m）。CTX 對 HiRISE 的對齊本身通過。門檻沒有放寬，結果維持未通過。一項跑之前就寫好的補充檢查直接拿地形比對 1,067 個 MOLA 雷射點（PEDR，不擬合水平平移）：HiRISE − MOLA −2.6 ± 7.4 m、CTX − MOLA −3.3 ± 7.2 m，在同樣門檻內；它與原結果並列，不取代原結果。同一批雷射點也與 463 m 的 MOLA 鑲嵌圖本身不一致（鑲嵌圖往西約 330 m、往北約 230 m 移最吻合），問題指向網格化的鑲嵌圖，而不是我們的取樣。`, `<b>The locked X3 elevation checks against MOLA do not pass here</b> (HiRISE − MOLA {hm} ± {hs} m; CTX − MOLA std {cs} m; limits 10 m). The CTX-to-HiRISE registration itself passes. The thresholds were not relaxed and the result stays a fail. A supplementary check written down before it was run compares the DTMs directly with 1,067 individual MOLA laser shots (PEDR, no horizontal shift fitted): HiRISE − MOLA −2.6 ± 7.4 m, CTX − MOLA −3.3 ± 7.2 m, within the same limits. It is reported next to the original result, not instead of it. The same shots also disagree with the 463 m MOLA mosaic itself (best agreement when that mosaic is moved about 330 m west and 230 m north), which points at the gridded mosaic rather than at our sampling.`],
  'dt.ab.L.wp': [`毅力號航點高程與 HiRISE 地形吻合到公分，因為兩者來自同一個地形模型；這只證明我們的座標鏈，不證明地形本身。獨立檢查是 2021-09-24（約 sol 212）的 HiRISE 影像：停著的毅力號離公布航點約 2 m。`, `Perseverance waypoint elevations agree with the HiRISE DTM to centimetres because they were derived from the same terrain model; that only proves our coordinate chain, not the DTM. The independent check is a HiRISE image from 2021-09-24 (sol ~212) that shows the parked rover itself about 2 m from its published waypoint.`],
  'dt.ab.L.views': [`照片拍攝方向只畫 Navcam。方向來自影像中繼資料的相機模型，依車體姿態旋轉；用 3 張 Navcam 照片的天際線對照 CTX 地形算出的地平線檢查（1° 內）。中繼資料裡的 <i>mastAz</i> 是相對車體的角度，不是羅盤方位。Front Hazcam 與 Mastcam-Z 沒檢查，地圖上不畫方向。`, `Photo viewing directions: only Navcam is drawn. The direction comes from the camera model in the image metadata rotated by the rover attitude; this was checked on 3 Navcam images by matching the photo skyline to the horizon computed from the CTX terrain model (within 1°). The <i>mastAz</i> value in the metadata is relative to the rover body and is not a compass bearing. Front Hazcam and Mastcam-Z were not checked and have no direction on the map.`],
  'dt.ab.L.arcadia': [`Arcadia 平原（水冰資源候選區）依團隊決定暫停；那裡完全沒有地面照片（最近的著陸器在 2,000 km 外）。`, `Arcadia Planitia (the ice-resource candidate region) is paused by team decision; it has no ground photos at all (nearest landers are more than 2,000 km away).`],
  'dt.ab.L.merc': [`MapLibre 用地球的 Web Mercator 公式畫火星座標；比例尺與座標以火星球體（R = 3,396.19 km）計算。影像圖層經重新取樣以對齊此顯示。`, `MapLibre draws Mars coordinates with Earth Web Mercator maths; the scale bar and coordinates are computed on the Mars sphere (R = 3,396.19 km). Image layers are resampled so they line up with this display.`],
  'dt.ab.L.review': [`定位檢查與地形判讀尚待人工審閱。`, `Positioning checks and terrain readings are <i>heuristic, not yet reviewed</i> by a person.`],

