  'sc.rule3': [`分數＝60 m 圓內的地形多樣性（堅實／崎嶇／沙地／不可通行比例的 Shannon 熵，0–1）＋ 30 m 內每個已揭開的 SuperCam 量測點 0.4 分（最多 3 個）。`, `Score = terrain variety in the 60 m circle (Shannon entropy of firm / rough / sand / blocked shares, 0–1) + 0.4 per SuperCam site within 30 m that lies in the revealed area (up to 3).`],
