  'sc.banner': [`這裡的數字只是示意，不屬於偵察前後的比較。氧氣模型參數是管線的<span class="badge assumed">假設</span>值。沙地類別是啟發式，尚未審閱。`, `Numbers here are illustrative only and are not part of the before/after comparison. Oxygen model parameters are the pipeline's <span class="badge assumed">assumed</span> values. Sand classes are heuristic, not yet reviewed.`],
